        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "春季"
      },
      {
        "id": "book024-b000378-p000-89b51e3726",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "永合门前，会出富贵之人。"
      },
      {
        "id": "book024-b000380-p000-96e47c7105",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "卷甲"
      },
      {
        "id": "book024-b000381-p000-83c6e2d389",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "若虽有雄势相见，天地交通，阴阳得位，定出三公。右水（风水语境中的河流、水系及其来去形态）似华头，子孙富贵无穷；左水似笋圭，长房会出科举魁首。"
      },
      {
        "id": "book024-b000385-p000-7302129536",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "左水（风水语境中的河流、水系及其来去形态）似笔头，家主会得田产与牛；右边有二水环抱，家中会有充足的金银财宝。"
      },
      {
        "id": "book024-b000387-p000-0716d5d8f6",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "二龙相会于门前，子嗣会入朝为官。"
      },
      {
        "id": "book024-b000391-p000-334163092f",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "水（风水语境中的河流、水系及其来去形态）后头兜住人皇州。"
      },
      {
        "id": "book024-b000393-p000-c2d8433cf6",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "不孝且多疾，二永从右边生出。",
        "uncertainty": [
          "原文中“1”“二永”含义不详"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "book024-b000394-p000-a2aea1441b",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "二龙穴（风水中认为气脉聚结、适宜安葬或营建的位置）后兜住，富贵永无休；东边浜水深百尺，西边有千粮。"
      },
      {
        "id": "book024-b000398-p000-d4698b0910",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "宅后有池，也是聚财之地；西北方向的池塘靠近冢边，子孙会不孝而呼皇天。此段出自《龙经》。",
        "uncertainty": [
          "原文中“番”字含义不详"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
